{"seq":4,"slug":"unsafe-pointers","title":"不安全指针","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/memory-model/unsafe-pointers","wordCount":839,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"不安全指针\">不安全指针</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Swift 的 <code>UnsafePointer</code> 家族提供了直接操作内存的能力，是与 C/Objective-C 互操作、高性能计算和底层系统编程的基础。虽然 Swift 是一门内存安全的语言，但 <code>Unsafe*</code> API 让开发者在需要时可以绕过安全检查，以获得最大的灵活性和性能。使用不安全指针需要开发者自行保证内存安全。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    UP[&quot;Unsafe Pointer 家族&quot;] --&gt; UPR[&quot;UnsafePointer (不可变)&quot;]&#10;    UP --&gt; UMP[&quot;UnsafeMutablePointer (可变)&quot;]&#10;    UP --&gt; URP[&quot;UnsafeRawPointer (原始)&quot;]&#10;    UP --&gt; UBP[&quot;UnsafeBufferPointer (缓冲区)&quot;]&#10;    UP --&gt; URBP[&quot;UnsafeRawBufferPointer&quot;]&#10;    UP --&gt; OMU[&quot;OpaquePointer (不透明)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    UP[\"Unsafe Pointer 家族\"] --&gt; UPR[\"UnsafePointer (不可变)\"]\n    UP --&gt; UMP[\"UnsafeMutablePointer (可变)\"]\n    UP --&gt; URP[\"UnsafeRawPointer (原始)\"]\n    UP --&gt; UBP[\"UnsafeBufferPointer (缓冲区)\"]\n    UP --&gt; URBP[\"UnsafeRawBufferPointer\"]\n    UP --&gt; OMU[\"OpaquePointer (不透明)\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Swift 默认是内存安全的语言，<code>Unsafe*</code> 指针家族则是它留给底层编程的「逃生舱」：当你需要与 C/Objective-C 互操作、做高性能计算或直接操作内存时，可以绕过安全检查，代价是<strong>内存安全由开发者自行保证</strong>。理解它需要分清指针的两个维度——可变性与类型化，以及配套的内存管理纪律：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>指针家族</strong>——按「可变/只读」和「类型化/原始」两个维度组合出 <code>UnsafePointer</code>、<code>UnsafeMutablePointer</code>、<code>UnsafeRawPointer</code>、<code>UnsafeBufferPointer</code> 等类型，另有 <code>OpaquePointer</code> 对应 C 的 <code>void*</code>；</li>\n<li><strong>内存生命周期</strong>——手动分配必须遵循 <code>allocate → initialize → use → deinitialize → deallocate</code> 顺序；</li>\n<li><strong><code>withUnsafe*</code> 作用域方法</strong>——推荐用它限制指针生命周期，防止指针逃逸出安全作用域；</li>\n<li><strong>类型绑定</strong>——原始指针需通过 <code>bindMemory</code> / <code>assumingMemoryBound</code> 建立类型绑定；</li>\n<li><strong>安全准则</strong>——最小化 unsafe 代码范围，绝不让指针逃逸、绝不在 deallocate 后访问。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括：<strong>不安全指针用「自行担保内存安全」换取对 C 互操作与极致性能的支持。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"unsafepointer-家族\">UnsafePointer 家族</h2><p>Swift 提供了一系列指针类型，每种有不同的能力和限制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>可变性</th>\n<th>类型化</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>UnsafePointer&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>只读</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>读取类型化内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UnsafeMutablePointer&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>读写</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>读写类型化内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UnsafeRawPointer</code></td>\n<td>只读</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>原始字节读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UnsafeMutableRawPointer</code></td>\n<td>读写</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>原始字节读写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UnsafeBufferPointer&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>只读</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>类型化连续缓冲区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UnsafeMutableBufferPointer&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>读写</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>可变连续缓冲区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OpaquePointer</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>C 的 void* 等不透明指针</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"let values = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]&#10;&#10;values.withUnsafeBufferPointer { buffer in&#10;    for i in 0..&lt;buffer.count {&#10;        print(buffer[i])&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    let pointer = buffer.baseAddress!&#10;    print(pointer.pointee)           // 10&#10;    print((pointer + 2).pointee)     // 30&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> values </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">values.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">withUnsafeBufferPointer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { buffer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">..&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">buffer.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(buffer[i])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pointer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buffer.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">baseAddress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pointer.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pointee</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((pointer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pointee</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"内存分配与释放\">内存分配与释放</h2><p>手动分配和管理内存：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"let count = 5&#10;let pointer = UnsafeMutablePointer&lt;Int&gt;.allocate(capacity: count)&#10;&#10;pointer.initialize(repeating: 0, count: count)&#10;&#10;for i in 0..&lt;count {&#10;    pointer[i] = i * 10&#10;}&#10;&#10;for i in 0..&lt;count {&#10;    print(pointer[i]) // 0, 10, 20, 30, 40&#10;}&#10;&#10;pointer.deinitialize(count: count)&#10;pointer.deallocate()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pointer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> UnsafeMutablePointer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">allocate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">capacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: count)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pointer.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">initialize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">repeating</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: count)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">..&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pointer[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">..&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pointer[i]) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 0, 10, 20, 30, 40</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pointer.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">deinitialize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: count)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pointer.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">deallocate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;allocate&quot;] --&gt; I[&quot;initialize&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; U[&quot;使用&quot;]&#10;    U --&gt; D[&quot;deinitialize&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;deallocate&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"allocate\"] --&gt; I[\"initialize\"]\n    I --&gt; U[\"使用\"]\n    U --&gt; D[\"deinitialize\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"deallocate\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 内存管理的步骤必须严格按顺序执行：allocate → initialize → use → deinitialize → deallocate。跳过任何步骤都可能导致未定义行为。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"withunsafe-系列方法\">withUnsafe* 系列方法</h2><p>Swift 推荐使用 <code>withUnsafe*</code> 闭包作用域方法来访问指针，确保指针不会逃逸：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"var numbers = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]&#10;&#10;let sum = numbers.withUnsafeBufferPointer { buffer -&gt; Int in&#10;    var total = 0&#10;    for element in buffer {&#10;        total += element&#10;    }&#10;    return total&#10;}&#10;&#10;numbers.withUnsafeMutableBufferPointer { buffer in&#10;    for i in buffer.indices {&#10;        buffer[i] *= 2&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;print(numbers) // [2, 4, 6, 8, 10]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numbers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numbers.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">withUnsafeBufferPointer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { buffer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buffer {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">numbers.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">withUnsafeMutableBufferPointer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { buffer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buffer.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">indices</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        buffer[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(numbers) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// [2, 4, 6, 8, 10]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用的 <code>withUnsafe*</code> 方法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// Array&#10;array.withUnsafeBufferPointer { }&#10;array.withUnsafeMutableBufferPointer { }&#10;array.withUnsafeBytes { }&#10;&#10;// String&#10;string.withCString { }&#10;string.withUTF8 { }&#10;&#10;// Data&#10;data.withUnsafeBytes { }&#10;data.withUnsafeMutableBytes { }&#10;&#10;// 手动内存&#10;withUnsafeTemporaryAllocation(byteCount: 1024, alignment: 8) { buffer in&#10;    // 使用临时缓冲区&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Array</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">array.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">withUnsafeBuffe