d>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>assumingMemoryBound(to:)</code></td>\n<td>假设已绑定</td>\n<td>如果假设错误则未定义行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>withMemoryRebound(to:capacity:)</code></td>\n<td>临时重新绑定</td>\n<td>闭包内安全</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"c-互操作\">C 互操作</h2><p>不安全指针是 Swift 与 C 互操作的桥梁：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import Darwin&#10;&#10;func readFile(path: String) throws -&gt; Data {&#10;    let fd = open(path, O_RDONLY)&#10;    guard fd &gt;= 0 else { throw POSIXError(.ENOENT) }&#10;    defer { close(fd) }&#10;&#10;    var stat = stat()&#10;    fstat(fd, &amp;stat)&#10;    let size = Int(stat.st_size)&#10;&#10;    let buffer = UnsafeMutablePointer&lt;UInt8&gt;.allocate(capacity: size)&#10;    defer {&#10;        buffer.deinitialize(count: size)&#10;        buffer.deallocate()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    let bytesRead = read(fd, buffer, size)&#10;    guard bytesRead == size else { throw POSIXError(.EIO) }&#10;&#10;    return Data(bytes: buffer, count: size)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Darwin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> readFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dar