olor:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sum) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 不安全指针的核心原则——最小化 unsafe 代码的范围，使用 <code>withUnsafe*</code> 方法限制指针生命周期，永远不要让指针逃逸出安全作用域。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Swift 提供 <code>UnsafePointer</code>、<code>UnsafeMutablePointer</code>、<code>UnsafeRawPointer</code> 等系列指针类型</li>\n<li>内存管理遵循 <strong>allocate → initialize → use → deinitialize → deallocate</strong> 流程</li>\n<li>推荐使用 <strong><code>withUnsafe*</code> 闭包</strong>限制指针生命周期，防止逃逸</li>\n<li>原始指针需要通过 <code>bindMemory</code> 或 <code>assumingMemoryBound</code> 进行类型绑定</li>\n<li>不安全指针是 <strong>C 互操作</strong>的桥梁，Swift 数组可直接传递给 C 函数</li>\n<li>最小化 unsafe 代码范围，在安全边界内封装不安全操作</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"不安全指针","id":"不安全指针"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"UnsafePointer 家族","id":"unsafepointer-家族"},{"level":2,"text":"内存分配与释放","id":"内存分配与释放"},{"level":2,"text":"withUnsafe\\* 系列方法","id":"withunsafe-系列方法"},{"level":2,"text":"原始指针与内存绑定","id":"原始指针与内存绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"C 互操作","id":"c-互操作"},{"level":2,"text":"安全准则","id":"安全准则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"写时复制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/memory-model/copy-on-write"},"next":{"title":"宏基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/macros-and-metaprogramming/macro-fundamentals"}}